About this project
Project Description Built an end-to-end Power BI analytics solution for a global chocolate retail business 
spanning 6 countries, 100 stores, and 1 million transactions across 2023–2024.
The project covered the full BI lifecycle profiling raw data across 5 CSV tables, resolving data quality issues
including orphan foreign keys and future-dated records, enriching a Calendar dimension with time intelligence columns, 
and designing a clean star schema model. Authored DAX measures across four layers
— base KPIs, time intelligence (YTD, MTD, YoY, rolling averages), customer segmentation, 
and dynamic UX titles — and delivered a 5-page interactive dashboard surfacing $25.5M in revenue insights,
a 40% profit margin, and actionable findings around store channel performance and loyalty program ROI. What I Found
- Airport stores lead revenue at $7.6M (29.9% share)Outperforms Mall, Online, and Retail - channelsLoyalty 
program delivers 50.1% of total revenue25,104 members — near-perfect program adoption - 
